(text "USB-C sink at 5 V only: 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2, up to 3 A from a Type-C source. No PD, no battery. JP1000 (open) joins the dev carrier 5 V to the P4 5 V pins: close it only when exactly one USB cable powers the stack." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c594c022-6554-5f20-86d7-1ca04811db15"))
